{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Shingeki no Kyojin: Chimi Kyara Gekijou - Rivai-han","Shingeki no Kyojin Season 3 DVD/BD specials. They are chibi parody shorts; one video was included on each of the DVD/BDs for a total of four. Each video contained three stories (essentially chibi parody short episode 38–49) which continued the chibi parody story from the previous chibi parody specials included on the DVD/BDs of the previous seasons."],"ja":["｢進撃の巨人｣ちみキャラ劇場”新生リヴァイ班”",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-39477","ids":{"shikimori":39477,"mal":39477,"anilist":108942,"kodik":"serial-32583"},"kodikIds":["serial-32583"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-32583":"2021-02-11T05:40:15Z"},"title":"Атака титанов 3: Спецвыпуски","originalTitle":"Shingeki no Kyojin Season 3 Specials","alt":"｢進撃の巨人｣ちみキャラ劇場”新生リヴァイ班”","description":"Продолжение « Атака титанов: Театр с монстрами — Вперёд, кадетский корпус! ». Специальные серии, включённые в Blu-Ray и DVD издания аниме « Атака титанов 3 » и « Атака титанов 3. Часть 2 », по каждому на одно издание тома, в общей сложности семь эпизодов. Как и предыдущие, эти спешлы выполнены полностью в тиби-стиле и являются пародией на некоторые сцены из аниме.","year":2018,"type":"SPECIAL","genres":["Сёнен","Комедия","пародия"],"rating":7.68,"popularity":16931,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/39477/2f16d69b619ebe5bed53bcc6fd554330.jpeg","width":445,"height":600},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/ad3767202d03ff71d5414f979fc6dbea94b8e780.jpg","width":1920,"height":1080}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":3,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-1442","dubId":"1442","label":"ХЗ Лол","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-32583","translationId":"1442","u